From: computerguy526 <355510486+computerguy526@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/25] kosmickrisp: KK_MSL_OVERRIDE_DIR (nps5 mslinject,
 default off): replacement MSL for app compute pipelines

<dir>/<b3>.metal (b3 = first 16 hex of BLAKE3 of KK's own MSL text) is compiled next to
KK's kernel (header '// kk-mslinject v1 local_size X Y Z entry NAME math M'); dispatches use
the replacement pipeline and threadgroup size, no loop-state binding. Runtime-only fields
in kk_shader (info/serialized blob unchanged -> warm caches stay valid). Fallback to KK's
kernel on compile failure. KK_MSL_OVERRIDE_PERIOD=<s>: in-run A/B phases (even=replacement),
KK_MSL_OVERRIDE_LOG=1: log every app compute key. Logs '[kk-mslinject] override <b3> ...'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
